{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55547","headline":"偈 十五 · 契此","name":"偈 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汝水若还清，汝身被水溺。\n汝柴若还燥，汝身被火燎。\n燎溺病同途，大梦原未觉。\n汝能鞭起悬，空灵觉心反。\n覆看渠非深，奥神光独耀。\n性真常现成，公案方知道。\n便能稳坐毗卢，顶上吹清调。\n（以上十一首，均见《卍续藏经》本《明州定应大师布袋和尚传》附元释广如撰《布袋和尚後序》。\n除「圆觉灵明超太虚」、「关非内外绝中央」、「汝水若还清」三首外的八首，又见於《明州岳林寺志》卷三。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"契此","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}